- This project uses `uv` for dependency management and task execution.
- The operating system is {{ host_os }}. Python {{ python_version }}.
- Maintain the AGENTS.md whenever major changes are made to the project.
- Prefer ASCII-only.

## Repository Layout

```text
.
|-- AGENTS.md                         # Instructions for AI coding agents
|-- README.md                         # Project overview and usage notes
|-- Makefile                          # Common local development commands
|-- pyproject.toml                    # Project metadata, dependencies, and tool config
|-- apm.yml                           # Dependency management of skills and agents
|-- .env.example                      # Example environment variables
|-- .pre-commit-config.yaml           # Pre-commit hook configuration
|-- .github/                          # Pull request, issue, Dependabot, and CI config
|-- .vscode/                          # Recommended editor settings and extensions
|-- .agents/skills/                   # Project-specific agent skills
|-- scripts/pre-commit-hooks/         # Local pre-commit hook scripts
|-- src/{{ package_name }}/           # Application package
`-- tests/                             # Pytest test suite
```

## Evaluation

Run these checks before handing off code changes:

```sh
uv run pytest
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format --check .
uv run pyrefly check
uv run prek run --all-files --show-diff-on-failure
```

Feel free to narrow the scope of the checks to only the files that were changed.
